---
title: Test - Chat Sequence Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant WEB as Web UI
    participant CHAT as Chat API
    participant STATE as State Store
    participant MODEL as Model Client
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant TOOLS as Tool Executor
    participant PERSIST as Artifact Persistence
    participant ARTIFACTS as Project Artifacts

    Dev->>WEB: Types message in sidebar
    WEB->>CHAT: chat(project_path: str, session_id: str, message: str) -> str
    Note right of CHAT: assert session_id is not empty
    Note right of CHAT: assert project_path exists on filesystem

    CHAT->>STATE: load_session(project_path: str, session_id: str)
    STATE-->>CHAT: list[Content]
    Note right of STATE: assert returns list (empty for new session)

    CHAT->>MODEL: generate_content(contents: list[Content], config: GenerateContentConfig, project_path: str)
    Note right of MODEL: assert contents has user message appended
    MODEL->>LLM: generate_content (HTTPS/gRPC)
    LLM-->>MODEL: Response
    Note right of MODEL: assert Response is not None

    alt Response is text
        MODEL-->>CHAT: Response
        Note right of CHAT: assert Response.text is non-empty str
        CHAT->>STATE: save_session(project_path: str, session_id: str, history: list[Content])
        Note right of STATE: assert history has user + model turns
        Note right of STATE: assert len(history) == prev + 2
        CHAT-->>WEB: str (text only)
        Note right of WEB: assert response is str, not Response
        WEB-->>Dev: Shows text in sidebar
    else Response has tool calls
        loop Until Response is text
            MODEL-->>TOOLS: handle_tool_calls(response: Response, history: list[Content], project_path: str)
            Note right of TOOLS: assert tool name exists in TOOL_FUNCTIONS
            Note right of TOOLS: assert tool args match expected schema
            TOOLS->>TOOLS: Execute (list_files, read_file, search_replace)
            Note right of TOOLS: assert tool result is str
            opt Tool writes a diagram or spec
                TOOLS->>PERSIST: save_artifact(project_path: str, rel_path: str, content: str)
                Note right of PERSIST: assert rel_path is within project_path
                PERSIST->>ARTIFACTS: Write to project repo
                Note right of ARTIFACTS: assert file exists after write
                Note right of ARTIFACTS: assert file content matches input
            end
            TOOLS-->>MODEL: Append tool call + results to history: list[Content]
            Note right of MODEL: assert history grew by 2 (tool call + tool result)
            MODEL->>LLM: generate_content (HTTPS/gRPC)
            LLM-->>MODEL: Response
        end
        MODEL-->>CHAT: Response
        Note right of CHAT: assert Response.text is non-empty str
        Note right of CHAT: assert no more tool calls in Response
        CHAT->>STATE: save_session(project_path: str, session_id: str, history: list[Content])
        Note right of STATE: assert history includes all tool turns
        CHAT-->>WEB: str (text only)
        Note right of WEB: assert response is str, not Response
        WEB-->>Dev: Shows text in sidebar
    end
